dialog 3 Bad selection for new screw thread.|This group can be created with:\n\n    * a circle or an arc (thread about its axis, from its plane)\n    * a cylindrical face of the solid (a screw's on a shaft, a nut's in a hole, from the part's end along the face)\n    * a circular edge at an end of a cylindrical face (from that end)\n
